1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,744
How do you make sure no single person can open the bank's secrets?

2
00:00:03,794 --> 00:00:08,328
Tear a treasure map into five pieces, and give them to five people.

3
00:00:08,378 --> 00:00:11,976
Any three can put it together, but no one alone can.

4
00:00:12,026 --> 00:00:14,136
Vault is opened the same way.

5
00:00:14,186 --> 00:00:19,416
At install, it is split into five key shares, and any three open it.

6
00:00:19,466 --> 00:00:25,104
Each keyholder keeps their own share, and nothing of the ceremony is written down anywhere.

7
00:00:25,154 --> 00:00:31,080
After every restart, Vault is sealed again, and three keyholders must unseal it.

8
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:36,504
A master key for setup is made only for that session, and always revoked at the end.

9
00:00:36,554 --> 00:00:42,432
And because the database backups are unreadable without that Vault, the two are always backed up together.

10
00:00:42,482 --> 00:00:44,808
Next: one install, everywhere.
